<title>HONG KONG: HK Jan property deals up 25 pct in value on month.</title>
<headline>HK Jan property deals up 25 pct in value on month.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong recorded 19,727 sale and purchase agreements worth HK$86.5 billion for residential and non-residential building units in January, the government Land Registry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The value of the agreements rose 24.8 percent from December 1996 and 280.4 percent from January last year, it said.</p>
<p>The number of deals rose 17.1 percent from December and 115.5 percent from January 1996, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
